For a reversible phase change at constant temperature,
\[
\Delta S=\frac{mL_f}{T}
\]
\[
\Delta S=\frac{(0.020)(3.34\times10^5)}{273}
\]
\[
\Delta S=24.5\,\mathrm{J\,K^{-1}}
\]

For vaporization,
\[
\Delta S=\frac{mL_v}{T}
\]
\[
\Delta S=\frac{(0.010)(2.26\times10^6)}{373}
\]
\[
\Delta S=60.6\,\mathrm{J\,K^{-1}}
\]
